":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids shows August to September and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the back end ran short, with September to October at 67% and August to September at 73% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids had March to April at 270% of normal. Grid 29576 had its driest year in 2007 at 71%.</p>"}
